{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026wqPYorhTpW1794802466.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地新樓樓價跌幅持續收窄。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》根據國家統計局數據推算，內地七十大中城市新樓樓價，10月按年跌百分之2.7，按月跌百分之0.1。</p><p></p><p>樓價按月上升的城市減少至14個，持平增至7個、下跌維持49個。國家統計局指，隨著各地房地產政策優化調整，市場出現一定積極變化，但部分地區仍承壓。當局將堅持因城施策控增量，去庫存、優供給等，推動房地產市場持續平穩健康地運行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:23:34.300065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":178,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T04:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T03:00:33.518578+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:16:58.658610+00:00","content_hash":"321dcd87bcdeceb396d358ac376e8e5860e3e0eb50605edfa76bd1bcce606542","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:23:34.300065+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}